// The player: a brown-haired traveller in a long cream tunic, a blue scarf
// tucked at the neck, a pack strap across the chest, a belt, and a tall
// rucksack on his back, the bedroll on top: the user's figure, 42 cells
// head to sole (the humanoids' size), drawn on the humanoid rig (parts put
// together into poses; crates/art) in a three-quarter view: the near arm
// hangs at the back of the body, its hand back by the pack, the far arm
// peeks out in front of it, the near leg in front. Facing right; the game
// mirrors it. The legs standing are drawn; every other pose's legs are
// made for it (two-bone legs reaching where the feet go: hero17's poses,
// 1.2 times the size; the hips close, the near thigh over the far; on the
// ground a foot is always planted, the stride drawn in where it wouldn't
// reach). The pack is the first layer of every pose (tagged `pack`): it
// comes off while something's worn on the back, a cape, a thruster pack
// (gear/look.rs). (The red-haired one in a vest:
// player_hero17.ron; the old green-tunic adventurer: player_classic.ron.)
(
    size: (44, 50),
    feet: (21.5, 50),
    outline: (19, 13, 8),
    palette: {
        'H': (47, 30, 14),        // hair, shade
        'h': (70, 42, 17),        // hair
        'j': (95, 59, 33),        // hair, lit
